<title>EGYPT: Egypt says seeks 25,000 T raw or white sugar.</title>
<headline>Egypt says seeks 25,000 T raw or white sugar.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's Sugar and Integrated Industries Company said on Monday it wanted to buy 25,000 tonnes of loose raw sugar or packed white sugar, buyer's option. The deadline for bids is 10 a.m. (0700 GMT) on Sept 17.</p>
<p>The company did not mention a date for shipment or delivery and company officials were not available.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Wright, Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
